gguf-rco step 6d: the Gluon decode kernels dispatched from _fused_mul_mat_gguf
for up to 16 rows of bf16 activations and the GGUF types that have one
(vllm_gguf_plugin/triton/gluon/); a merged layer's shard is passed as the
strided view on that path instead of a per-step .contiguous() copy.
Applies after 0022 and 0023.

